{% extends 'layouts/page.njk' %}

{% block content %}
  <div class="govuk-grid-row">
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
      <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">About Design help</h1>

      <p class="govuk-body">
        The Defra design team has moved to a management model where resource managers support line management. This has improved administration and the smooth running of core management responsibilities.
      </p>
      <p class="govuk-body">
        At the same time, it can leave a gap in design-focused support. Things like design critiques, design tooling help and longer-term coaching are now more dependent on the design community supporting itself.
      </p>

      <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">User need</h2>
      <p class="govuk-body">
        Designers need a simple way to find and offer support to each other, without relying only on informal networks or existing personal contacts.
      </p>

      <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Why this matters</h2>
      <p class="govuk-body">
        Our team has a lot of experience and knowledge to share. This tool is intended to prompt people to both find help and offer help, with managers supporting the process.
      </p>

      <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">What this first version is for</h2>
      <p class="govuk-body">
        This is a first iteration. We can keep it, adapt it, improve it, or stop using it based on feedback and evidence of what works.
      </p>
      <p class="govuk-body">
        The intent is that everyone takes an active role in helping each other in our profession.
      </p>
      <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
        <li>finding a file or piece of code</li>
        <li>getting feedback on an idea</li>
        <li>support with design tooling and critiques</li>
        <li>career planning and coaching</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="govuk-body">Think about two things:</p>
      <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
        <li>what you can offer</li>
        <li>what you would like help with</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="govuk-body">
        If you find something that does not work or a bug, you can <a class="govuk-link govuk-link--no-visited-state" href="{{ feedbackLinkHref }}">give feedback about this service</a> (about 2 minutes). You can also speak to your line manager.
      </p>

      <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">How it has been built</h2>
      <p class="govuk-body">
        There is a longer account of the technology, how the service is hosted, use of assistive AI in development, accessibility choices, and what we have (and have not) assured for security.
      </p>
      <p class="govuk-body govuk-!-margin-bottom-0">
        <a class="govuk-link govuk-link--no-visited-state" href="/how-it-has-been-built">Read more about how design help was built</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
{% endblock %}
